### TeamForge Phase 8 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Decision Finality, Data Integrity & Consolidated Notification Store

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Submit a User Report
# Expected Status: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportedUserId": "3",
  "reason": "Harassment",
  "details": "User has repeatedly used abusive language in workspace chat channels."
}

###

### 2. Admin Resolves Report with Warning
# Expected Status: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/rep-1/action
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "warn",
  "reason": "Official warning issued for violating code of conduct."
}

###

### 3. Second Action on Already Actioned Report (Finality Check)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Code: REPORT_ALREADY_ACTIONED
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/rep-1/action
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "warn",
  "reason": "Attempting second action on already resolved report."
}

###

### 4. Patch Status on Already Actioned Report (Finality Check)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Code: REPORT_ALREADY_ACTIONED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/rep-1/status
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Dismissed",
  "note": "Attempting status override."
}

###

### 5. Submit an Appeal Against a Warning
# Expected Status: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/warnings/warn-1/appeal
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "explanation": "I apologize for the misunderstanding and request this warning be reviewed."
}

###

### 6. Admin Rejects Appeal
# Expected Status: 200/201 OK/Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/appeals/appeal-1/decision
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject",
  "note": "Violation was explicit. Warning upheld upon administrative review."
}

###

### 7. Second Decision on Decided Appeal (Finality Check)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Code: APPEAL_ALREADY_DECIDED
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/appeals/appeal-1/decision
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "accept",
  "note": "Attempting to accept previously rejected appeal."
}

###

### 8. Complete Project with 0 Tasks (Refused)
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: PROJECT_NO_TASKS
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-zero-tasks/complete
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: Project Owner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalLink": "https://github.com/teamforge/zero-task-repo"
}

###

### 9. Complete Project with 1 Approved Task (Completes without badge)
# Expected Status: 201 Created
# Expected Response: { status: "Completed", isCompleted: true, badgeAwarded: false, badgeReason: "Completed. Badges need at least 3 approved tasks" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-one-task/complete
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: Project Owner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalLink": "https://github.com/teamforge/one-task-repo"
}

###

### 10. Approve Join Request (Queued & Serialized)
# Expected Status: 200 OK (First call) / 409 Conflict (Duplicate / Full)
# Expected Code on 409: REQUEST_ALREADY_DECIDED or PROJECT_FULL
PUT {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/req-123/status
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: Project Owner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

###

### 11. Fetch Consolidated Notifications
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: Seeded notifications array from single store
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json
